    ## Data Health Check as a Service - Enterprise Backend
    
    **DHCaaS** provides comprehensive data quality monitoring, governance, 
    and compliance management for enterprise data teams.
    
    ### Key Features:
    - JWT Authentication - Secure user registration and login
    - Data Quality Scanning - Multi-dimensional quality analysis
    - Compliance Monitoring - GDPR, CCPA, HIPAA compliance checks
    - Predictive Analytics - ML-powered anomaly detection
    - Quality Metrics - Completeness, validity, consistency, accuracy
    - PII Detection - Automatic sensitive data identification
    - PDF Reports - Professional enterprise-grade compliance reports
    - Scan Jobs Management - Asynchronous data source scanning
    - Incident Management - Track and resolve data quality issues
    - Real-time Analytics - Dashboard with live metrics
    - AI Remediation Engine - Automated fix recommendations with SQL generation
    - Advanced Validation - Email/Phone validation, duplicate detection, outlier analysis
    - Master Data Management - Fuzzy matching, identity resolution, Customer 360
    - Developer Portal - API key management and programmatic access
    """,
    version="2.2.0",
    openapi_url=f"{settings.API_V1_STR}/openapi.json",
    docs_url="/docs",
    redoc_url="/redoc",
)


# ============================================================
